WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Customers, leads & tags”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Customers
From the menu open Customers and search for the contact you need or add a customer.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Review the data
Fill in the name, contact details and the available data accurately.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Organize with tags
From Tags prepare clear categories and use them to follow conversations and to segment your audience.
